ushi.\n- Peach cannot be placed in either list because it is liked by Bao and Riya but disliked by Wei, Fay, and Tara.\n- Ravioli cannot be placed in either list because it is liked by Liv and Riya but disliked by Wei, Fay, Bao, and Tara.\n\nSince all food items are either liked or disliked by different people and there is no item that satisfies the criteria of being either distinctly orderable or not without dissatisfaction from at least one participant, we cannot form a combination that satisfies all participants. Therefore, both 'orderable' and 'not_orderable' lists must be empty.\n\nHence, the final solution is:\n\n`orderable = []`\n`not_orderable = []`", 'num_prompt_tokens': 270, 'num_completion_tokens': 527}
